{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfYfJx2phyyGLyt2kqM9Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Answer: Yulofu\nActions taken: none\n\nYulofu is the only service that meets both deadlines. It packs on 2045-11-16, dispatches on 2045-11-19 and delivers on 2045-11-26.\n\nThe others miss a deadline:\n- Nonobo dispatches on 11-20 but delivers on 11-27, a day late.\n- Yaravu dispatches on 11-21 and delivers on 11-28.\n- Lazeke dispatches on 11-22 and delivers on 11-29."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":452,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":305,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":134},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}